cs11AddSection("cs11-u5",{"id": "cs11-s160-p151", "title": "Figure 5.26 Mesh Topology; advantages and disadvantages of a mesh topology", "headingUrdu": "شکل ۵.۲۶ میش ٹوپولوجی؛ میش ٹوپولوجی کے فوائد اور نقصانات", "headingPashto": "انځور ۵.۲۶ جال توپولوژي؛ د جال توپولوژۍ ګټې او زیانونه", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 160, "printedPage": "151"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s160-h1", "cs11-s160-a1", "cs11-s160-a2", "cs11-s160-a3", "cs11-s160-h2", "cs11-s160-d1", "cs11-s160-d2", "cs11-s160-d3"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Mesh topology: six computers each connected to every other computer\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:440px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"70\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"330\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"240\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"330\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"200\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"210\" y1=\"240\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"90\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"110\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"52\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"316\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"316\" y=\"182\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"196\" y=\"222\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"182\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"76\" y=\"92\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#7ac6e8\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"210\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text><text x=\"75\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text><text x=\"350\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text><text x=\"210\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Computer</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s160-fig1", "caption": "Figure 5.26 Mesh Topology", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۵.۲۶ میش ٹوپولوجی", "captionPashto": "انځور ۵.۲۶ جال توپولوژي", "labels": [{"en": "Computer", "ur": "کمپیوٹر", "ps": "کمپیوټر"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 151: Figure 5.26 Mesh Topology (six computers each joined to every other computer, each marked with the printed label “Computer”; redrawn as coded SVG), the advantages (three bullets) and the disadvantages (three bullets) of a mesh topology. A handwritten word at the top right is excluded. Photographs and clip-art are not reproduced; diagrams are redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T13:19:18.949528+00:00", "scope": "Scan 160 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("Advantages of Mesh topology","میش ٹوپولوجی کے فوائد","د جال توپولوژۍ ګټې",{"id": "cs11-s160-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Data can be transmitted from different devices simultaneously. This topology can withstand high traffic.","ڈیٹا مختلف آلات سے بیک وقت منتقل کیا جا سکتا ہے۔ یہ ٹوپولوجی بھاری ٹریفک برداشت کر سکتی ہے۔","ډېټا له مختلفو وسایلو په یو وخت لېږدول کېدای شي. دا توپولوژي لوړ ترافیک زغملای شي.",{"id": "cs11-s160-a1", "listGroup": "ms_adv"}),
cs11Pair("Even if one of the components fails there is always an alternative link present. So data transfer doesn’t get affected.","اگر کوئی ایک جزو ناکام بھی ہو جائے تو ہمیشہ ایک متبادل ربط موجود ہوتا ہے۔ اس لیے ڈیٹا کی منتقلی متاثر نہیں ہوتی۔","که یو جز هم ناکام شي، تل یو بدیل تړاو شته. نو د ډېټا لېږد نه اغېزمنېږي.",{"id": "cs11-s160-a2", "listGroup": "ms_adv"}),
cs11Pair("Expansion and modification in topology can be done without disrupting other nodes.","ٹوپولوجی میں توسیع اور ترمیم دوسرے نوڈز میں خلل ڈالے بغیر کی جا سکتی ہے۔","په توپولوژۍ کې پراختیا او تعدیل د نورو غوټو د خرابولو پرته کېدای شي.",{"id": "cs11-s160-a3", "listGroup": "ms_adv"}),
cs11Pair("Disadvantages of Mesh topology","میش ٹوپولوجی کے نقصانات","د جال توپولوژۍ زیانونه",{"id": "cs11-s160-h2", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("There are high chances of redundancy in many of the network connections.","نیٹ ورک کے کئی کنکشنز میں فالتو پن کے امکانات زیادہ ہیں۔","د شبکې په ډیرو پیوستونو کې د زیاتوالي لوړ احتمال شته.",{"id": "cs11-s160-d1", "listGroup": "ms_dis"}),
cs11Pair("Overall cost of this network is too high as compared to other network topologies.","دوسری نیٹ ورک ٹوپولوجیز کے مقابلے میں اس نیٹ ورک کی مجموعی لاگت بہت زیادہ ہے۔","د نورو شبکې توپولوژیو په پرتله د دې شبکې ټوله لګښت ډیر لوړ دی.",{"id": "cs11-s160-d2", "listGroup": "ms_dis"}),
cs11Pair("Set-up and maintenance of this topology is very difficult. Even administration of the network is challenging.","اس ٹوپولوجی کی ترتیب اور دیکھ بھال بہت مشکل ہے۔ حتیٰ کہ نیٹ ورک کا انتظام بھی چیلنجنگ ہے۔","د دې توپولوژۍ جوړول او ساتنه ډیره ستونزمنه ده. حتی د شبکې مدیریت هم ننګونکی دی.",{"id": "cs11-s160-d3", "listGroup": "ms_dis"})
]});
