cs11AddSection("cs11-u5",{"id": "cs11-s162-p153", "title": "OSI model layers; Figure 5.27", "headingUrdu": "او ایس آئی ماڈل کی تہیں؛ شکل ۵.۲۷", "headingPashto": "د OSI ماډل طبقې؛ انځور ۵.۲۷", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 162, "printedPage": "153"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s162-o5", "cs11-s162-h1", "cs11-s162-a", "cs11-s162-b", "cs11-s162-l1", "cs11-s162-l2", "cs11-s162-l3", "cs11-s162-l4", "cs11-s162-l5", "cs11-s162-l6", "cs11-s162-l7"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 390 290\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"OSI seven layers: application, presentation, session, transport, network, data link and physical, shown for transmitting and receiving stations\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:390px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><text x=\"190\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">OSI 7 Layer</text><polygon points=\"20,55 140,45 160,59 40,71\" fill=\"#8b2e2e\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Application</text><polygon points=\"230,55 350,45 370,59 250,71\" fill=\"#8b2e2e\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"63\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Application</text><polygon points=\"20,87 140,77 160,91 40,103\" fill=\"#8fc7c9\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Presentation</text><polygon points=\"230,87 350,77 370,91 250,103\" fill=\"#8fc7c9\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"95\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Presentation</text><polygon points=\"20,119 140,109 160,123 40,135\" fill=\"#8fa8d6\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"127\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Session</text><polygon points=\"230,119 350,109 370,123 250,135\" fill=\"#8fa8d6\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"127\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Session</text><polygon points=\"20,151 140,141 160,155 40,167\" fill=\"#8ec99b\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Transport</text><polygon points=\"230,151 350,141 370,155 250,167\" fill=\"#8ec99b\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"159\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Transport</text><polygon points=\"20,183 140,173 160,187 40,199\" fill=\"#d33\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Network</text><polygon points=\"230,183 350,173 370,187 250,199\" fill=\"#d33\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"191\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Network</text><polygon points=\"20,215 140,205 160,219 40,231\" fill=\"#e8a43a\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Data Link</text><polygon points=\"230,215 350,205 370,219 250,231\" fill=\"#e8a43a\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"223\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Data Link</text><polygon points=\"20,247 140,237 160,251 40,263\" fill=\"#e86a3a\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Physical</text><polygon points=\"230,247 350,237 370,251 250,263\" fill=\"#e86a3a\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"300\" y=\"255\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">Physical</text><text x=\"60\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Transmit Data</text><text x=\"255\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Receive Data</text><line x1=\"170\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"260\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><text x=\"195\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Physical Link</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s162-fig1", "caption": "Figure 5.27 OSI Model Layers", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۵.۲۷ او ایس آئی ماڈل کی تہیں", "captionPashto": "انځور ۵.۲۷ د OSI ماډل طبقې", "labels": [{"en": "Transmit Data", "ur": "ڈیٹا بھیجیں", "ps": "ډېټا ولېږئ"}, {"en": "Receive Data", "ur": "ڈیٹا وصول کریں", "ps": "ډېټا ترلاسه کړئ"}, {"en": "Physical Link", "ur": "طبعی ربط", "ps": "فزیکي تړاو"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 153: the last point of the OSI list (continuing from page 152), “OSI MODEL LAYERS” with two paragraphs and the list of the seven layers, and Figure 5.27 OSI Model Layers (stacks of seven layers for a transmitting and a receiving computer, titled “OSI 7 Layer”, with the labels Transmit Data, Receive Data and Physical Link; redrawn as coded SVG). The page is crossed by handwriting at the top and the right side, which is excluded. Photographs and clip-art are not reproduced; diagrams are redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T13:20:42.612534+00:00", "scope": "Scan 162 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("How different protocols work with devices on a network to arrange data.","مختلف پروٹوکولز نیٹ ورک پر آلات کے ساتھ ڈیٹا کو ترتیب دینے کے لیے کیسے کام کرتے ہیں۔","مختلف پروتوکولونه په شبکه د وسایلو سره د ډېټا د ترتیبولو لپاره څنګه کار کوي.",{"id": "cs11-s162-o5", "listGroup": "osi_do2"}),
cs11Pair("OSI MODEL LAYERS","او ایس آئی ماڈل کی تہیں","د OSI ماډل طبقې",{"id": "cs11-s162-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("The OSI model defines a networking framework for implementing protocols in seven different layers. Control is passed from one layer to the next, starting at the application layer in one station, and proceeding to the bottom layer, over the channel to the next station and back up the hierarchy.","او ایس آئی ماڈل سات مختلف تہوں میں پروٹوکولز نافذ کرنے کے لیے نیٹ ورکنگ کا ڈھانچہ متعین کرتا ہے۔ کنٹرول ایک تہہ سے اگلی تہہ کو منتقل ہوتا ہے، ایک اسٹیشن میں ایپلیکیشن لیئر سے شروع ہو کر نچلی تہہ تک، پھر چینل کے ذریعے اگلے اسٹیشن تک اور درجہ بندی میں واپس اوپر تک۔","د OSI ماډل په اوو مختلفو طبقو کې د پروتوکولونو د پلي کولو لپاره د شبکې چوکاټ ټاکي. کنټرول له یوې طبقې نه بلې ته لېږدول کېږي، په یوه ایستګاه کې له اپلېکېشن طبقې پیلېږي، لاندېنۍ طبقې ته ځي، د چینل له لارې بلې ایستګاه ته او په درجه بندۍ کې بېرته پورته ځي.",{"id": "cs11-s162-a"}),
cs11Pair("The OSI model divides communications into seven different layers, where each include multiple hardware standards, protocols, or, other types of services. The OSI model has following seven layers.","او ایس آئی ماڈل مواصلات کو سات مختلف تہوں میں تقسیم کرتا ہے، جن میں سے ہر ایک میں متعدد ہارڈ ویئر معیارات، پروٹوکولز یا دیگر قسم کی خدمات شامل ہیں۔ او ایس آئی ماڈل کی درج ذیل سات تہیں ہیں۔","د OSI ماډل اړیکې په اوو مختلفو طبقو وېشي، چې هره یوه څو هارډویر معیارونه، پروتوکولونه یا نور ډول خدمتونه لري. د OSI ماډل لاندې اوه طبقې لري.",{"id": "cs11-s162-b"}),
cs11Pair("Physical Layer","فزیکل لیئر","فزیکي طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l1", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Data Link Layer","ڈیٹا لنک لیئر","د ډېټا نښلونې طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l2", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Network Layer","نیٹ ورک لیئر","د شبکې طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l3", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Transport Layer","ٹرانسپورٹ لیئر","د لېږد طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l4", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Session Layer","سیشن لیئر","د ناستې طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l5", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Presentation Layer","پریزنٹیشن لیئر","د وړاندې کولو طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l6", "listGroup": "osi_l"}),
cs11Pair("Application Layer","ایپلیکیشن لیئر","د اپلېکېشن طبقه",{"id": "cs11-s162-l7", "listGroup": "osi_l"})
]});
