cs11AddSection("cs11-u5",{"id": "cs11-s174-p165", "title": "Figure 5.29 OSI Model Versus TCP Model; 5.3.3 Packet Switching and Circuit Switching", "headingUrdu": "شکل ۵.۲۹ او ایس آئی ماڈل بمقابلہ ٹی سی پی ماڈل؛ ۵.۳.۳ پیکٹ سوئچنگ اور سرکٹ سوئچنگ", "headingPashto": "انځور ۵.۲۹ د OSI ماډل پرتله د TCP ماډل؛ ۵.۳.۳ د کڅوړې سویچنګ او د سرکټ سویچنګ", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 174, "printedPage": "165"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s174-h1", "cs11-s174-h2", "cs11-s174-a", "cs11-s174-h3", "cs11-s174-b"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 440 305\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"OSI seven layers compared with the four layers of the TCP/IP model\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:440px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"29.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">7</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"10\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"29.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Application</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"50\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"69.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">6</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"50\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"69.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Presentation</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"90\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"109.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">5</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"90\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"109.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Session</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"130\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"149.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">4</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"130\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"149.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Transport</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"170\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"189.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">3</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"170\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"189.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Network</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"210\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"229.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">2</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"210\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"229.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Data Link</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"250\" width=\"40\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30.0\" y=\"269.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">1</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"250\" width=\"160\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"58\" y=\"269.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Physical</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"10\" width=\"170\" height=\"110\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"335.0\" y=\"69.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Application</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"130\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"335.0\" y=\"149.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">(Host-to-Host) Transport</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"170\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"335.0\" y=\"189.0\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Internet</text><rect x=\"250\" y=\"210\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"335.0\" y=\"229.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Network Interface</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Hardware</text><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"125\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"125\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"165\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"165\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"205\" x2=\"250\" y2=\"205\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 2\"/><text x=\"100\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">OSI Model</text><text x=\"335\" y=\"295\" font-size=\"12\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">TCP/IP Model</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s174-fig1", "caption": "Figure 5.29 OSI Model Versus TCP Model", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۵.۲۹ او ایس آئی ماڈل بمقابلہ ٹی سی پی ماڈل", "captionPashto": "انځور ۵.۲۹ د OSI ماډل پرتله د TCP ماډل", "labels": [{"en": "OSI Model", "ur": "او ایس آئی ماڈل", "ps": "د OSI ماډل"}, {"en": "TCP/IP Model", "ur": "ٹی سی پی / آئی پی ماڈل", "ps": "د TCP/IP ماډل"}, {"en": "Hardware", "ur": "ہارڈ ویئر", "ps": "هارډویر"}, {"en": "(Host-to-Host) Transport", "ur": "(ہوسٹ ٹو ہوسٹ) ٹرانسپورٹ", "ps": "(کوربه-په-کوربه) لېږد"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 165: Figure 5.29 OSI Model Versus TCP Model (the seven OSI layers numbered 7 to 1 beside the four-part TCP/IP model with dotted joining lines and the words “Hardware”, “OSI Model” and “TCP/IP Model”; redrawn as coded SVG), the banner “5.3.3 Packet Switching and Circuit Switching”, “Packet Switching” and the start of “Circuit Switching”. The top of the page is slightly cut so that the unit header is partly hidden. Photographs and clip-art are not reproduced; diagrams are redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T13:25:34.832710+00:00", "scope": "Scan 174 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("5.3.3 Packet Switching and Circuit Switching","۵.۳.۳ پیکٹ سوئچنگ اور سرکٹ سوئچنگ","۵.۳.۳ د کڅوړې سویچنګ او د سرکټ سویچنګ",{"id": "cs11-s174-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Packet Switching","پیکٹ سوئچنگ","د کڅوړې سویچنګ",{"id": "cs11-s174-h2", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Packet switching is a network communication method in which the data get transmitted in blocks, regardless of type and content, called packets based on the destination address in each packet. When received, packets are reassembled in the proper sequence to make up the message. In this kind of switching, the media capacity is used optimally, and the response time is lesser.","پیکٹ سوئچنگ نیٹ ورک مواصلات کا ایسا طریقہ ہے جس میں ڈیٹا، قسم اور مواد سے قطع نظر، ہر پیکٹ میں موجود منزل کے پتے کی بنیاد پر پیکٹس نامی بلاکس میں منتقل ہوتا ہے۔ وصول ہونے پر پیکٹس کو درست ترتیب میں دوبارہ جوڑ کر پیغام بنایا جاتا ہے۔ اس قسم کی سوئچنگ میں وسیلے کی گنجائش بہترین طریقے سے استعمال ہوتی ہے اور جواب کا وقت کم ہوتا ہے۔","د کڅوړې سویچنګ د شبکې د اړیکو یوه طریقه ده چې په کې ډېټا، د ډول او منځپانګې له پامه پرته، په هره کڅوړه کې د منزل پتې پر بنسټ په بلاکونو کې چې کڅوړې بلل کېږي لېږدول کېږي. کله چې ترلاسه شي کڅوړې په سمه ترتیب بیا یوځای کېږي ترڅو پیغام جوړ کړي. پدې ډول سویچنګ کې د رسنۍ ظرفیت په غوره ډول کارول کېږي او د ځواب وخت لږ وي.",{"id": "cs11-s174-a"}),
cs11Pair("Circuit Switching","سرکٹ سوئچنگ","د سرکټ سویچنګ",{"id": "cs11-s174-h3", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Circuit switching is a scheme in which the network sets up a dedicated point-to-point connection between nodes and terminals before the communication starts, just like the nodes were already connected.","سرکٹ سوئچنگ ایسی اسکیم ہے جس میں نیٹ ورک مواصلات شروع ہونے سے پہلے نوڈز اور ٹرمینلز کے درمیان ایک مخصوص نقطہ بہ نقطہ ربط قائم کرتا ہے، بالکل ایسے جیسے نوڈز پہلے سے جڑے ہوں۔","د سرکټ سویچنګ یوه طرحه ده چې په کې شبکه د اړیکو له پیلېدو مخکې د غوټو او ټرمینلونو ترمنځ یو ځانګړی نقطه-په-نقطه تړاو جوړوي، لکه چې غوټې مخکې له مخکې وصل وي.",{"id": "cs11-s174-b"})
]});
// END CS SOURCE SCAN 174

