cs11AddSection("cs11-u6",{"id": "cs11-s189-p180", "title": "Wireless network components; Figure 6.1; access points; wireless client", "headingUrdu": "وائرلیس نیٹ ورک کے اجزاء؛ شکل ۶.۱؛ ایکسیس پوائنٹس؛ وائرلیس کلائنٹ", "headingPashto": "د بې سیمې شبکې اجزا؛ انځور ۶.۱؛ لاسرسي نقطې؛ بې سیمه پېرېدونکی", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 189, "printedPage": "180"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s189-a"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s189-b", "cs11-s189-c"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 480 305\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Wireless network: internet, modem, firewall, wireless router, access point, database server, multifunction device and wireless clients\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:480px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><text x=\"150\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Internet</text><circle cx=\"190\" cy=\"65\" r=\"35\" fill=\"#2a4a6a\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"45\" y=\"55\" width=\"35\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#888\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"30\" y=\"85\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Antenna</text><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"65\" x2=\"60\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"60\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"100\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"40\" y=\"150\" width=\"22\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"5\" y=\"195\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Sentech's MyWireless Modem</text><rect x=\"105\" y=\"135\" width=\"38\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#d9541e\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"105\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Firewall</text><line x1=\"143\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"200\" y2=\"150\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><rect x=\"200\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"22\" fill=\"#445\" stroke=\"#111\"/><line x1=\"215\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"210\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><line x1=\"250\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"255\" y2=\"115\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><text x=\"180\" y=\"185\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Wireless-G</text><text x=\"165\" y=\"197\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Broadband Router</text><text x=\"180\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">(54-108Mbps)</text><rect x=\"180\" y=\"245\" width=\"22\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#ddd\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"215\" y=\"275\" font-size=\"10\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Database Server</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"238\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Single Access Point</text><text x=\"100\" y=\"249\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">with up to 253 Clients</text><rect x=\"240\" y=\"230\" width=\"42\" height=\"28\" fill=\"#666\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"285\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Multifunction Print/Copy/Scan/Fax</text><rect x=\"330\" y=\"20\" width=\"14\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#bbb\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"350\" y=\"20\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Voice over Internet Protocol (VoIP phone)</text><rect x=\"340\" y=\"95\" width=\"20\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#456\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"366\" y=\"105\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Wireless LAN Client (PDA)</text><rect x=\"335\" y=\"150\" width=\"50\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#444\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"390\" y=\"170\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Wireless LAN Client</text><rect x=\"345\" y=\"210\" width=\"45\" height=\"35\" fill=\"#555\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"395\" y=\"225\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Wireless LAN Client</text><path d=\"M300 45 Q310 55 300 65\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M300 110 Q310 120 300 130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M300 170 Q310 180 300 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/><path d=\"M300 225 Q310 235 300 245\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#111\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg>", "id": "cs11-s189-fig1", "caption": "Figure 6.1 Wireless Network", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۶.۱ وائرلیس نیٹ ورک", "captionPashto": "انځور ۶.۱ بې سیمه شبکه", "labels": [{"en": "Internet", "ur": "انٹرنیٹ", "ps": "انټرنېټ"}, {"en": "Antenna", "ur": "اینٹینا", "ps": "انتن"}, {"en": "Firewall", "ur": "فائر وال", "ps": "اور دیوال"}, {"en": "Wireless-G Broadband Router (54-108Mbps)", "ur": "وائرلیس-جی براڈ بینڈ راؤٹر (۵۴ تا ۱۰۸ ایم بی پی ایس)", "ps": "بې سیمه-G براډبېنډ روټر (۵۴-۱۰۸ Mbps)"}, {"en": "Single Access Point with up to 253 Clients", "ur": "واحد ایکسیس پوائنٹ جو ۲۵۳ کلائنٹس تک کو سنبھال سکتا ہے", "ps": "یوه لاسرسي نقطه تر ۲۵۳ پېرېدونکو پورې"}, {"en": "Database Server", "ur": "ڈیٹا بیس سرور", "ps": "د ډېټابېس خدمتګار"}, {"en": "Voice over Internet Protocol (VoIP phone)", "ur": "وائس اوور انٹرنیٹ پروٹوکول (وی او آئی پی فون)", "ps": "د انټرنېټ پروتوکول له لارې غږ (VoIP تلیفون)"}, {"en": "Wireless LAN Client", "ur": "وائرلیس لین کلائنٹ", "ps": "بې سیمه LAN پېرېدونکی"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 180: the sentence on the two main components of a wireless network, Figure 6.1 Wireless Network (a picture of an Internet globe, an antenna, a modem, a firewall, a wireless router, an access point, a database server, a multifunction device and several wireless clients with the printed labels; redrawn as coded SVG) and the paragraphs on access points and wireless clients. “Access points” and “wireless client” are printed in bold. The printed name “Sentech’s MyWireless Modem” is kept in the figure. Photographs and clip-art are not reproduced; diagrams are redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T13:31:18.949700+00:00", "scope": "Scan 189 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("The two main components of a wireless network are wireless router or access point and wireless clients.","وائرلیس نیٹ ورک کے دو بنیادی اجزاء وائرلیس راؤٹر یا ایکسیس پوائنٹ اور وائرلیس کلائنٹس ہیں۔","د بې سیمې شبکې دوه اصلي اجزا بې سیمه روټر یا لاسرسي نقطه او بې سیمه پېرېدونکي دي.",{"id": "cs11-s189-a"}),
cs11Pair("Access points act as a central transmitter and receiver of wireless radio signals including Wi-Fi and are used to support public internet hot spots.","ایکسیس پوائنٹس وائی فائی سمیت وائرلیس ریڈیو سگنلز کے مرکزی ٹرانسمیٹر اور ریسیور کے طور پر کام کرتے ہیں اور عوامی انٹرنیٹ ہاٹ اسپاٹس کی حمایت کے لیے استعمال ہوتے ہیں۔","لاسرسي نقطې د وای-فای په ګډون د بې سیمو راډیو سیګنالونو د مرکزي لېږونکي او ترلاسه کوونکي په توګه کار کوي او د عامو انټرنېټ ګرم ځایونو ملاتړ لپاره کارول کېږي.",{"id": "cs11-s189-b"}),
cs11Pair("A computer or a device equipped with a wireless LAN network adaptor is known as wireless client. These can communicate directly with each other or through a wireless access point.","وائرلیس لین نیٹ ورک اڈاپٹر سے لیس کمپیوٹر یا آلہ وائرلیس کلائنٹ کہلاتا ہے۔ یہ ایک دوسرے سے براہِ راست یا وائرلیس ایکسیس پوائنٹ کے ذریعے رابطہ کر سکتے ہیں۔","هغه کمپیوټر یا وسیله چې د بې سیمې LAN شبکې اډاپټر سره سمبال وي بې سیمه پېرېدونکی بلل کېږي. دا کولای شي یو له بل سره مستقیم یا د بې سیمې لاسرسي نقطې له لارې اړیکه ونیسي.",{"id": "cs11-s189-c"})
]});
