cs11AddSection("cs11-u7",{"id": "cs11-s251-p242", "title": "3rd Normal Form (end); Figures 7.29 and 7.30", "headingUrdu": "تھرڈ نارمل فارم (اختتام)؛ شکلیں ۷.۲۹ اور ۷.۳۰", "headingPashto": "دریمه نورمال بڼه (پای)؛ انځورونه ۷.۲۹ او ۷.۳۰", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 251, "printedPage": "242"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s251-a", "cs11-s251-h1", "cs11-s251-h2"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "figure", "index": 1}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 262 60\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Table structure: Emp_no, Emp_name, Job_class\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:262px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"64\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c9a6a6\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"42.0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Emp_no</text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"33\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"74\" y=\"10\" width=\"80\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8fb4e0\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"114.0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Emp_name</text><rect x=\"154\" y=\"10\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8fb4e0\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"198.0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Job_class</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s251-fig1", "caption": "Figure 7.29 Employee Table", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۷.۲۹ ایمپلائی ٹیبل", "captionPashto": "انځور ۷.۲۹ د کارکوونکي جدول", "labels": []}, {"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 230 60\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Table structure: Job_class, Chg_per_hour\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:230px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"10\" width=\"88\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#c9a6a6\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"54.0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Job_class</text><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"33\" x2=\"90\" y2=\"33\" stroke=\"#111\"/><rect x=\"98\" y=\"10\" width=\"112\" height=\"30\" fill=\"#8fb4e0\" stroke=\"#111\"/><text x=\"154.0\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Chg_per_hour</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s251-fig2", "caption": "Figure 7.30 Job Table", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۷.۳۰ جاب ٹیبل", "captionPashto": "انځور ۷.۳۰ د دندې جدول", "labels": []}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 242: the closing paragraph of 3rd Normal Form, the Employee Table (Figure 7.29: Emp_no, Emp_name, Job_class) and the Job Table (Figure 7.30: Job_class, Chg_per_hour), both redrawn as coded SVG with the key columns underlined as printed. The rest of the page is blank. “Chg_per_hour” is printed in the Job Table. Diagrams are redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T13:54:33.411802+00:00", "scope": "Scan 251 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("Both Job_class and Charge_per_hour are nonprime attributes and the later one is dependent on the former. So by removing transitive dependency the following new tables will be created.","جاب_کلاس اور چارج_فی_آور دونوں غیر بنیادی ایٹریبیوٹس ہیں اور بعد والا پہلے والے پر منحصر ہے۔ اس لیے ترسیلی انحصار ہٹانے سے درج ذیل نئے ٹیبلز بنیں گے۔","Job_class او Charge_per_hour دواړه غیر لومړني خاصیتونه دي او وروستی په مخکني پورې تړلی دی. نو د انتقالي تکیې په لېرې کولو سره به لاندې نوي جدولونه جوړ شي.",{"id": "cs11-s251-a"}),
cs11Pair("Employee Table","ایمپلائی ٹیبل","د کارکوونکي جدول",{"id": "cs11-s251-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Job Table","جاب ٹیبل","د دندې جدول",{"id": "cs11-s251-h2", "kind": "heading"})
]});
