cs11AddSection("cs11-u8",{"id": "cs11-s269-p260", "title": "Figure 8.12 Exam Table; 8.2.2 Data Types in MS-Access 2007 (1–3)", "headingUrdu": "شکل ۸.۱۲ ایگزام ٹیبل؛ ۸.۲.۲ ایم ایس ایکسیس ۲۰۰۷ میں ڈیٹا ٹائپس (۱ تا ۳)", "headingPashto": "انځور ۸.۱۲ د ازموینې جدول؛ ۸.۲.۲ په MS-Access 2007 کې د ډېټا ډولونه (۱ تر ۳)", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 269, "printedPage": "260"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s269-a"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s269-h1", "cs11-s269-b", "cs11-s269-c", "cs11-s269-d", "cs11-s269-e"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 445 215\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Access Design View: Exam ID, Roll No, Exam Type, Marks obtained\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:445px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"435\" height=\"205\" fill=\"#f4f7fb\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"435\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#cfd9ea\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"222.5\" y=\"17\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Student : Database (Access 2007) — Microsoft Access</text><circle cx=\"22\" cy=\"35\" r=\"8\" fill=\"#d9b04a\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"45\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Home</text><text x=\"113\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Create</text><text x=\"181\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">External Data</text><text x=\"249\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Database Tools</text><text x=\"317\" y=\"39\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Design</text><rect x=\"10\" y=\"46\" width=\"420\" height=\"36\" fill=\"#e8eef8\" stroke=\"#aaa\"/><rect x=\"10\" y=\"95\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"15\" y=\"108\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">All Tables</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"124\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Student</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Student : Table</text><text x=\"15\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Exam</text><text x=\"30\" y=\"162\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Exam : Table</text><rect x=\"115\" y=\"95\" width=\"315\" height=\"62\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"135\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Field Name</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Data Type</text><text x=\"340\" y=\"107\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Description</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Exam ID</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Number</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Roll No</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Number</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Exam Type</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Text</text><text x=\"135\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Marks obtained</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"150\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Number</text><rect x=\"115\" y=\"160\" width=\"315\" height=\"40\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"120\" y=\"172\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">General  Lookup</text><text x=\"120\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Field Size    Long Integer</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s269-fig1", "caption": "Figure 8.12 Exam Table", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۸.۱۲ ایگزام ٹیبل", "captionPashto": "انځور ۸.۱۲ د ازموینې جدول", "labels": [{"en": "Exam ID", "ur": "ایگزام آئی ڈی", "ps": "د ازموینې پېژند"}, {"en": "Roll No", "ur": "رول نمبر", "ps": "رول شمېره"}, {"en": "Exam Type", "ur": "ایگزام کی قسم", "ps": "د ازموینې ډول"}, {"en": "Marks obtained", "ur": "حاصل کردہ نمبر", "ps": "ترلاسه شوې نمرې"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 260: Figure 8.12 Exam Table (a Design View screenshot of the Exam table with the fields Exam ID, Roll No, Exam Type and Marks obtained; redrawn as simplified coded SVG), the banner “8.2.2 Data Types in MS-Access 2007” with the first three of nine data types (Text, Memo, Number; the Number sentence continues on the next page). The words Text, Memo and Number are printed in bold. Screenshots are not reproduced; each screenshot is redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the legible printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T14:01:24.297081+00:00", "scope": "Scan 269 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("Figure 8.12 shows Exam table created in Student database.","شکل ۸.۱۲ اسٹوڈنٹ ڈیٹا بیس میں بنایا گیا ایگزام ٹیبل دکھاتی ہے۔","۸.۱۲ انځور د زده کوونکو ډېټابېس کې جوړ شوی د ازموینې جدول ښيي.",{"id": "cs11-s269-a"}),
cs11Pair("8.2.2 Data Types in MS-Access 2007","۸.۲.۲ ایم ایس ایکسیس ۲۰۰۷ میں ڈیٹا ٹائپس","۸.۲.۲ په MS-Access 2007 کې د ډېټا ډولونه",{"id": "cs11-s269-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("There are nine types of field data types which are used in Access 2007.","ایکسیس ۲۰۰۷ میں استعمال ہونے والی فیلڈ ڈیٹا ٹائپس کی نو اقسام ہیں۔","په Access 2007 کې د کارېدونکو ساحو د ډېټا ډولونو نهه ډولونه شته.",{"id": "cs11-s269-b"}),
cs11Pair("1. Text: Access assigns Text as the default data type to all fields. The maximum size of text field is 255 characters. All types of characters i.e. alphabets, numbers and special characters are allowed in text data type.","۱۔ ٹیکسٹ: ایکسیس تمام فیلڈز کو ڈیفالٹ ڈیٹا ٹائپ کے طور پر ٹیکسٹ تفویض کرتا ہے۔ ٹیکسٹ فیلڈ کا زیادہ سے زیادہ سائز ۲۵۵ حروف ہے۔ ٹیکسٹ ڈیٹا ٹائپ میں ہر قسم کے حروف یعنی حروفِ تہجی، اعداد اور خصوصی علامات کی اجازت ہے۔","۱. متن (Text): Access متن د ټولو ساحو لپاره د ډیفالټ ډېټا ډول په توګه ټاکي. د متن ساحې اعظمي کچه ۲۵۵ توري دي. د متن په ډېټا ډول کې د هر ډول توري یعنې الفبا، عددونه او ځانګړي نښې اجازه لري.",{"id": "cs11-s269-c"}),
cs11Pair("2. Memo: Memo data type allows as many as 63999 characters to fields. Users use them to provide descriptive text comments. Access displays the contents of Memo fields in a Datasheet view. A memo field cannot be a Primary key field.","۲۔ میمو: میمو ڈیٹا ٹائپ فیلڈز کو ۶۳۹۹۹ حروف تک کی اجازت دیتی ہے۔ صارفین انہیں وضاحتی متنی تبصرے فراہم کرنے کے لیے استعمال کرتے ہیں۔ ایکسیس میمو فیلڈز کے مواد کو ڈیٹا شیٹ ویو میں دکھاتا ہے۔ میمو فیلڈ پرائمری کی فیلڈ نہیں ہو سکتی۔","۲. یادښت (Memo): د یادښت د ډېټا ډول ساحو ته تر ۶۳۹۹۹ توري اجازه ورکوي. کاروونکي هغه د تشریحي متني نظرونو لپاره کاروي. Access د یادښت ساحو منځپانګه په ډېټا شیټ لید کې ښيي. د یادښت ساحه د لومړنۍ کیلي ساحه نشي کېدای.",{"id": "cs11-s269-d"}),
cs11Pair("3. Number: Number data type is assigned to numeric fields. Various numeric data subtypes are available in the Field Properties pane of Table Design","۳۔ نمبر: نمبر ڈیٹا ٹائپ عددی فیلڈز کو تفویض کی جاتی ہے۔ ٹیبل ڈیزائن کے فیلڈ پراپرٹیز پین میں مختلف عددی ڈیٹا ذیلی اقسام دستیاب ہیں","۳. شمېره (Number): د شمېرې د ډېټا ډول عددي ساحو ته ټاکل کېږي. د جدول ډیزاین د ساحې ملکیتونو پټه کې مختلف عددي ډېټا فرعي ډولونه شته",{"id": "cs11-s269-e", "cont": true})
]});
// END CS SOURCE SCAN 269

