cs11AddSection("cs11-u8",{"id": "cs11-s287-p278", "title": "Command button (end); b. Adding a Logo; Figure 8.28 Form Icon", "headingUrdu": "کمانڈ بٹن (اختتام)؛ ب۔ لوگو شامل کرنا؛ شکل ۸.۲۸ فارم آئیکن", "headingPashto": "د حکم تڼۍ (پای)؛ ب. لوګو زیاتول؛ انځور ۸.۲۸ د فورم انځورن", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 287, "printedPage": "278"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s287-a", "cs11-s287-h1", "cs11-s287-b"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s287-c", "cs11-s287-d", "cs11-s287-l1", "cs11-s287-l2", "cs11-s287-l3"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 430 245\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Form with the form icon circled beside the title Student, fields Roll No, St Name, Class and Section and the related Exam records\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:430px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><text x=\"10\" y=\"15\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Form icon</text><rect x=\"5\" y=\"22\" width=\"410\" height=\"215\" fill=\"#f4f7fb\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"22\" width=\"410\" height=\"45\" fill=\"#8fb4d8\" stroke=\"#555\"/><circle cx=\"55\" cy=\"45\" r=\"16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#c22\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><rect x=\"45\" y=\"38\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"85\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Student</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Roll No:</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"80\" width=\"300\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">1</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"117\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">St Name:</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"105\" width=\"300\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"117\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Ahmed</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Class:</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"130\" width=\"300\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">XI</text><text x=\"40\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Section:</text><rect x=\"90\" y=\"155\" width=\"300\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#888\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"167\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">B</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"190\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Exam ID    Exam Type    Marks obtained</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"203\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">1  First Term   450</text><text x=\"35\" y=\"214\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">2  Second Term   470</text><text x=\"25\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Record: 1 of 4    No Filter    Search</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s287-fig1", "caption": "Figure 8.28 Form Icon", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۸.۲۸ فارم آئیکن", "captionPashto": "انځور ۸.۲۸ د فورم انځورن", "labels": [{"en": "Form icon", "ur": "فارم آئیکن", "ps": "د فورم انځورن"}, {"en": "Student", "ur": "اسٹوڈنٹ", "ps": "زده کوونکی"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 278: the closing sentence of the command button steps, “b. Adding a Logo” with its paragraph, Figure 8.28 Form Icon (a form screenshot with the form icon circled and labelled “Form icon”; redrawn as simplified coded SVG), the paragraph on the Logo command and three steps. The words Logo, Controls, Ribbon, Insert Picture and Ok are printed in bold or special type. Screenshots are not reproduced; each screenshot is redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the legible printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T14:07:18.560238+00:00", "scope": "Scan 287 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("The command button should be operational and appear on the form in Form View.","کمانڈ بٹن کو فعال ہونا چاہیے اور فارم ویو میں فارم پر ظاہر ہونا چاہیے۔","د حکم تڼۍ باید فعاله وي او په فورم لید کې په فورم کې ښکاره شي.",{"id": "cs11-s287-a"}),
cs11Pair("b. Adding a Logo","ب۔ لوگو شامل کرنا","ب. لوګو زیاتول",{"id": "cs11-s287-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("Access automatically puts a form icon, like the one shown in Figure 8.28, in the header area of every form that you create.","ایکسیس آپ کے بنائے ہوئے ہر فارم کے ہیڈر ایریا میں خود بخود فارم آئیکن رکھتا ہے، جیسا کہ شکل ۸.۲۸ میں دکھایا گیا ہے۔","Access په اتوماتیک ډول ستاسو د جوړ شوي هر فورم د سرلیک په سیمه کې د فورم انځورن ږدي، لکه هغه چې ۸.۲۸ انځور کې ښودل شوی.",{"id": "cs11-s287-b"}),
cs11Pair("One way to customize the look of forms is to remove that icon and replace it with a logo. This is very easy to do using the Logo command.","فارمز کی شکل کو حسبِ ضرورت بنانے کا ایک طریقہ اس آئیکن کو ہٹانا اور اس کی جگہ لوگو لگانا ہے۔ لوگو کمانڈ استعمال کر کے یہ کرنا بہت آسان ہے۔","د فورمونو د بڼې د دودیز کولو یوه لار دا ده چې دا انځورن لېرې کړئ او په ځای یې لوګو کېږدئ. د Logo حکم په کارولو سره دا کول ډیر اسان دي.",{"id": "cs11-s287-c"}),
cs11Pair("The following steps are used to replace the form icon with a logo of choice.","فارم آئیکن کو پسندیدہ لوگو سے بدلنے کے لیے درج ذیل اقدامات استعمال ہوتے ہیں۔","د فورم انځورن د خوښې لوګو سره د بدلولو لپاره لاندې ګامونه کارول کېږي.",{"id": "cs11-s287-d"}),
cs11Pair("Delete the form icon.","فارم آئیکن حذف کریں۔","د فورم انځورن حذف کړئ.",{"id": "cs11-s287-l1", "listGroup": "lg"}),
cs11Pair("Select the Logo command from the Controls group on the Ribbon.","ربن پر کنٹرولز گروپ سے لوگو کمانڈ منتخب کریں۔","په ربن د Controls ډلې نه د Logo حکم وټاکئ.",{"id": "cs11-s287-l2", "listGroup": "lg"}),
cs11Pair("Use the Insert Picture dialog box to locate the picture file to use as the logo. Then, click Ok. The new logo should appear.","لوگو کے طور پر استعمال کرنے والی تصویر کی فائل تلاش کرنے کے لیے انسرٹ پکچر ڈائیلاگ باکس استعمال کریں۔ پھر ٹھیک ہے پر کلک کریں۔ نیا لوگو ظاہر ہو جانا چاہیے۔","د لوګو په توګه د کارولو لپاره د انځور فایل موندلو لپاره د Insert Picture خبرې اترې بکس وکاروئ. بیا Ok کلیک کړئ. نوی لوګو باید ښکاره شي.",{"id": "cs11-s287-l3", "listGroup": "lg"})
]});
