cs11AddSection("cs11-u8",{"id": "cs11-s298-p289", "title": "Report tools; 8.5.1 Using the Report Wizard to generate a Report; Figure 8.37 Report Wizard", "headingUrdu": "رپورٹ کے اوزار؛ ۸.۵.۱ رپورٹ ویزرڈ کے ذریعے رپورٹ بنانا؛ شکل ۸.۳۷ رپورٹ ویزرڈ", "headingPashto": "د راپور وسایل؛ ۸.۵.۱ د Report Wizard په کارولو راپور جوړول؛ انځور ۸.۳۷ د راپور مرستندوی", "sourceLanguage": "en", "source": {"pdfPage": 298, "printedPage": "289"}, "auditStatus": "corrected; unresolved source", "flow": [{"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s298-a", "cs11-s298-h1", "cs11-s298-b", "cs11-s298-s1"]}, {"type": "figure", "index": 0}, {"type": "paragraphs", "ids": ["cs11-s298-s2", "cs11-s298-s3"]}], "equations": [], "figures": [{"svg": "<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 430 227\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Report Wizard dialog box: Which fields do you want on your report?\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:430px;height:auto;background:#fff\"><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"420\" height=\"215\" fill=\"#fbf7d8\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"5\" y=\"5\" width=\"420\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"12\" y=\"17\" font-size=\"9\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Report Wizard</text><rect x=\"12\" y=\"28\" width=\"130\" height=\"145\" fill=\"#f2b84a\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"150\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Which fields do you want on your report?</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">You can choose from more than one table or query.</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"72\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Tables/Queries</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"76\" width=\"130\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"153\" y=\"86\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Table: Student</text><text x=\"150\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Available Fields:</text><rect x=\"150\" y=\"106\" width=\"115\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"151\" y=\"107\" width=\"113\" height=\"10\" fill=\"#6a1a2a\"/><text x=\"155\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">St Name</text><text x=\"155\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Class</text><text x=\"155\" y=\"146\" font-size=\"7\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#111\">Section</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Selected Fields:</text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"106\" width=\"115\" height=\"70\" fill=\"#fff\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"118\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"272\" y=\"134\" width=\"20\" height=\"12\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><rect x=\"150\" y=\"190\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"180.0\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Cancel</text><rect x=\"220\" y=\"190\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"247.5\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">< Back</text><rect x=\"285\" y=\"190\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"312.5\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Next ></text><rect x=\"350\" y=\"190\" width=\"60\" height=\"16\" fill=\"#eee\" stroke=\"#555\"/><text x=\"380.0\" y=\"201\" font-size=\"8\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#111\">Finish</text></svg>", "id": "cs11-s298-fig1", "caption": "Figure 8.37 Report Wizard", "captionUrdu": "شکل ۸.۳۷ رپورٹ ویزرڈ", "captionPashto": "انځور ۸.۳۷ د راپور مرستندوی", "labels": [{"en": "Tables/Queries", "ur": "ٹیبلز/کوئریز", "ps": "جدولونه/پوښتنې"}, {"en": "Available Fields", "ur": "دستیاب فیلڈز", "ps": "شته ساحې"}, {"en": "Selected Fields", "ur": "منتخب فیلڈز", "ps": "ټاکل شوې ساحې"}]}], "sourceNote": "Printed page 289: the paragraph on report tools, the banner “8.5.1 Using the Report Wizard to generate a Report” with its lead-in sentence and the first step, Figure 8.37 Report Wizard (the wizard dialog with the Tables/Queries drop-down, the Available Fields list St Name, Class, Section and the Selected Fields list; redrawn as simplified coded SVG, the small text is illegible) and two more steps (the figures for the next steps follow on the next page). The words Create, Ribbon, Report Wizard, Reports group, Tables/Queries, Fields, Next and Grouping Levels are printed in bold. Screenshots are not reproduced; each screenshot is redrawn as simplified coded SVG with the legible printed labels. Watermark, border lines, page-edge shadows and handwriting are excluded.", "review": {"reviewedAtUtc": "2026-10-13T14:11:33.209887+00:00", "scope": "Scan 298 compared with source", "unresolved": "Translations need native review"}, "paras": [
cs11Pair("Access offers tools that allow users to create and format a report. The Report Wizard takes users through the steps of creating a report. The Report command, however, is much easier to use, and all of the formatting options are still available in Layout View once the report is created. With these tools, user can create a report based on a table or a query.","ایکسیس ایسے اوزار پیش کرتا ہے جو صارفین کو رپورٹ بنانے اور اس کی فارمیٹنگ کرنے دیتے ہیں۔ رپورٹ ویزرڈ صارفین کو رپورٹ بنانے کے مراحل سے گزارتا ہے۔ تاہم رپورٹ کمانڈ استعمال کرنا بہت آسان ہے اور رپورٹ بن جانے کے بعد فارمیٹنگ کے تمام اختیارات لے آؤٹ ویو میں اب بھی دستیاب ہیں۔ ان اوزار کے ساتھ صارف ٹیبل یا کوئری پر مبنی رپورٹ بنا سکتا ہے۔","Access داسې وسایل وړاندې کوي چې کاروونکو ته د راپور د جوړولو او بڼه کولو اجازه ورکوي. د Report Wizard کاروونکي د راپور د جوړولو ګامونو له لارې بیایي. د Report حکم، خو، د کارولو لپاره ډیر اسان دی، او د بڼې ټول اختیارونه لا هم په Layout View کې شته وروسته له دې چې راپور جوړ شي. له دغو وسایلو سره کاروونکی کولای شي د جدول یا پوښتنې پر بنسټ راپور جوړ کړي.",{"id": "cs11-s298-a"}),
cs11Pair("8.5.1 Using the Report Wizard to generate a Report","۸.۵.۱ رپورٹ ویزرڈ کے ذریعے رپورٹ بنانا","۸.۵.۱ د Report Wizard په کارولو راپور جوړول",{"id": "cs11-s298-h1", "kind": "heading"}),
cs11Pair("The following steps are used to generate a report using Report Wizard.","رپورٹ ویزرڈ کے ذریعے رپورٹ بنانے کے لیے درج ذیل اقدامات استعمال ہوتے ہیں۔","د Report Wizard په کارولو د راپور د جوړولو لپاره لاندې ګامونه کارول کېږي.",{"id": "cs11-s298-b"}),
cs11Pair("Select the Create tab on the Ribbon. Then click Report Wizard from the Reports group to open the pop up window. As shown in Figure 8.37.","ربن پر کریٹ ٹیب منتخب کریں۔ پھر پاپ اپ ونڈو کھولنے کے لیے رپورٹس گروپ سے رپورٹ ویزرڈ پر کلک کریں۔ جیسا کہ شکل ۸.۳۷ میں دکھایا گیا ہے۔","په ربن د Create ټب وټاکئ. بیا د پاپ اپ کړکۍ د پرانیستلو لپاره د Reports ډلې نه Report Wizard کلیک کړئ. لکه څنګه چې ۸.۳۷ انځور کې ښودل شوی.",{"id": "cs11-s298-s1", "listGroup": "rw1"}),
cs11Pair("Select data for Report from Tables/Queries drop down menu and then select the required Fields. Click Next.","رپورٹ کے لیے ڈیٹا ٹیبلز/کوئریز ڈراپ ڈاؤن مینو سے منتخب کریں اور پھر مطلوبہ فیلڈز منتخب کریں۔ نیکسٹ پر کلک کریں۔","د راپور لپاره ډېټا د Tables/Queries ښکته کېدونکي مېنو نه وټاکئ او بیا اړینې ساحې وټاکئ. Next کلیک کړئ.",{"id": "cs11-s298-s2", "listGroup": "rw2"}),
cs11Pair("Next step is for Grouping Levels, where user can add grouping levels if required. We do not need it for this particular example. Click Next.","اگلا مرحلہ گروپنگ لیولز کے لیے ہے، جہاں صارف ضرورت ہو تو گروپنگ لیولز شامل کر سکتا ہے۔ ہمیں اس خاص مثال کے لیے اس کی ضرورت نہیں۔ نیکسٹ پر کلک کریں۔","راتلونکی ګام د Grouping Levels لپاره دی، چېرته چې کاروونکی کولای شي که اړتیا وي د ډلبندۍ کچې زیاتې کړي. موږ دې ځانګړې بېلګې لپاره ورته اړتیا نه لرو. Next کلیک کړئ.",{"id": "cs11-s298-s3", "listGroup": "rw2"})
]});
